// # mem — Linear Arena + ARC + Alignment
//
// Logline: The O(1) bulk-reset linear arena, the deterministic ARC (atomic ref-counted), and the 64-byte aligned payload allocator.
//
// Setup: alloc.c is the bulk allocator; arena.c is the bulk-reset linear layer; align.c is the OO_PAYLOAD_ALIGN 64-byte payload alignment; weak.c is the ARC control block + weak reference primitives.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Read weak.h — the OoControlBlock + OoWeakRef types and OO_FLAG_* values.
//   2. Read weak.c — the C11-atomic retain/release semantics.
//   3. Read arena.c — the linear arena (create/alloc/reset/destroy).
//   4. Read alloc.c — the bulk allocator that backs the arena.
//   5. Read align.c — the 64-byte aligned payload primitive.
//
// ──▓▓ mem ANCHOR ──▓▓──
// :: Pillar 7 — deterministic, no GC ::
